  <activityDataset>
    <activityDescription>
      <activity id="007c62fe-71da-55bb-bf11-5f267b83302a" activityNameId="01d20d3a-530b-587f-8151-cd6b7ced2ef9" activityNameContextId="f44c43c1-5cc5-54a6-ade6-24435bd12c83" type="1" specialActivityType="0" energyValues="0">
        <activityName xml:lang="en">Gold, from combined gold-silver production, at refinery</activityName>
        <generalComment>
          <text xml:lang="en" index="1">Full activity name: Gold, from combined gold-silver production, at refinery
This multi-output process 'mining and refining, gold-silver deposit' delivers the two co-products 'gold, from combined gold-silver-production, at refinery' and 'silver, from combined gold-silver-production, at refinery'. This data set includes the mining in Peru in open pit mines incl. land use.  Air emissions are estimated.;
UUID: 9a1a176d-0f83-37b8-80a8-8a4a6d4b5a0e
This data set includes the combined mining and refining of gold and silver in open pit mines in Peru incl. energy and material use, water and air emissions of metals and land use.
Location: Material requirements are estimated with Australian data, water emissions are estimated with Data from Papua New Guinea
Technology: The mining of ore from open pit mines is considered.
Time period: Period of public environmental report
Production volume: 102.64 t gold and 36.66 t silver per year
Sampling: environmental report 
Extrapolations: See Geography, estimations have been made for refinement of Gold 
Uncertainty adjustments: none
BAFU mapped export: unsupported biosphere exchanges excluded; see audit/. Local UUIDs and generic activity classification are export conventions. Source: process_9a1a176d-0f83-37b8-80a8-8a4a6d4b5a0e.xml</text>
        </generalComment>
      </activity>
      <geography geographyId="59ee9e0a-2929-50ed-abff-ba7056cb7891" geographyContextId="f44c43c1-5cc5-54a6-ade6-24435bd12c83">
